                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i></div><h3>2. Founder built a live logistics SaaS</h3><p>Trackmate Lite is a founder-built logistics product in production use. Every ITD conversation with freight buyers is grounded in operational context &mdash; AWB, BOL, POD, house vs master bills, INCOTERMS, tariff-line HSN interpretation.</p></div>
